      "content": "\"let go of the pretense\"... that's exactly it. it's all just a performance. i look at people and they're all just pretending too, but i'm too tired to keep the mask on. it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy body around for no reason. is there even a way out of this feeling, or is this just what it is now? everything is just empty.",
